{"id":"en_love-gossip","title":"Love Gossip","titleEn":"Love Gossip","description":"Seong Hyesung has face blindness and turns to a skincare salon whenever stress builds up. During one visit, an employee mentions a love blog written by Kwon Yunseul, and he begins reading it. The two start exchanging comments, eventually meet in person, and develop feelings for each other. Their relationship is put in jeopardy, however, when Yunseul receives an offer to publish her blog posts as a book, since the material centers on her ex-boyfriend.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/love-gossip/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/love-gossip/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Drama","Romance"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7doh4k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_love-gossip_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7doh4k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_love-gossip_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7doh4k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_love-gossip_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7doh4k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_love-gossip_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7doh4k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_love-gossip_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"number":5,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7doh4k/?pub=4occak","kind